  style: {
    stroke: "#0D47A1"
    stroke-width: 2
    stroke-dash: 4
  }
  tooltip: "ID: canonicalizer_to_ledger\nRelationship: writes\nContract: events, entities, typed relationship tables\nAuthentication: database workload credential\nMode: sync\nTimeout: 5s\nRetries: one transaction retry\nIdempotency: event_id unique constraint\nFallback: event remains pending\nFailure propagation: event is not durable\nEvidence: intended/design_document: docs/agent-provenance-ledger-and-codex-feedback.md:1#Agent Provenance Ledger and Codex Feedback Plan @ 979a81d07994f8024c3b071581165de94685d2ca; intended/external_document: https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/datatype-json.html @ PostgreSQL 18 current documentation; intended/external_document: https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ddl-constraints.html @ PostgreSQL 18 current documentation"
